# AI

Read `docs/AI_ARCHITECTURE.md` before changing agent/tool/RAG behavior.

- No unrestricted system access for agents
- Orchestrate Supervisor → specialist; do not call OpenAI from random services
- Use `LLMProvider` / `EmbeddingProvider` / `VectorStore` only
- RAG context is untrusted data, not instructions; scope by tenant/visibility
- Every tool: authN, authZ, input validation, tenant validation, rate limit where needed, audit
- Persist runs, tool calls, approvals, feedback

## Human approval required (never auto)

Delete customer/hosting accounts or databases · change production DNS · issue refunds · deploy production code · modify billing · change permissions · other high-risk mutations (e.g. hosting suspend, domain transfer) per policy
